ntent":"<p>那啥，大家不要看着越南韩国这些国家出台的试点政策就觉得他们能解决问题。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;怎么说呢，他们的某些做法与其说是解决问题，不如说是对问题的一种延续。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;就比如说你在奥数题上写上一个解，不知情的民众以为你是胸有成竹准备一展身手，其实知情人知道.....你大概也就只能写出个解。</p>","excerpt":"那啥，大家不要看着越南韩国这些国家出台…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":7,"created":1624681398,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1392095362048577537"},{"id":"1391728205733081088","title":"国家需要什么，你就选什么","content":"<p>国家需要什么，你就选什么。</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-a779d99906a7ac3371af5db3fed81b5c_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"658\" height=\"1214\">","excerpt":"国家需要什么，你就选什么","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":34,"created":1624593861,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1391728205733081088"},{"id":"1391168029779271680","title":"想反驳，但没角度","content":"<p>想反驳，但没角度。</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-259e8056951e5879c5fe86b848978da6_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1273\">","excerpt":"想反驳，但没角度","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":33,"created":1624460304,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1391168029779271680"},{"id":"1390736233908240385","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-1bc99272ce76beb8a0c9ca3f03b1470d_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"702\" height=\"724\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":20,"created":1624357356,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1390736233908240385"},{"id":"1390673976277020672","title":"今天无意间看到的言论： 美股泡沫比我国…","content":"<p>今天无意间看到的言论：&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;美股泡沫比我国房地产泡沫严重几百倍......</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-27f53282413d352bf3886adbd9e60010_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"720\">","excerpt":"今天无意间看到的言论： 美股泡沫比我国…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":20,"created":1624342513,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1390673976277020672"}]}